course: dictionary
lesson: 7530
title: The prankster and the mess
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A prankster is a person who likes playing pranks, which are tricks or jokes played on other people. You can spot the meaning from the clues around the word, such as tricks, jokes and laughing.
explain: «Pranks that need cleaning up should be cleaned up by the prankster.» The clue is cleaning up: the trick made a mess, so the person who played it must tidy it. Prankster must mean the person who plays the tricks.
explain: Check by swapping in your meaning: "the person who plays tricks should clean up the pranks" still makes sense, so the meaning is right. A good prank makes everyone laugh, the person tricked too. A trick that scares, hurts or breaks things is not funny.
fact: A prankster is a person who likes playing pranks.
fact: A prank is a trick or joke played on other people.
fact: Prankster is a noun: a prankster, pranksters.
fact: A class prankster is someone in the class who often plays tricks; a famous prankster is well known for their pranks.
fact: A good prank makes everyone laugh, including the person tricked.
exercise: «Pranks that need cleaning up should be cleaned up by the prankster.» What is a prankster? | A person who tells sad stories | A type of cushion | A person who cleans up messes | *A person who likes playing tricks or jokes on other people
exercise: Lily says a prankster is a person who is very tidy. What is the right meaning? | *A person who likes playing pranks, tricks or jokes on other people | A person who sings loudly | A person who always wins races | A person who is very tidy and neat
exercise: Which kind of prank is not a good one? | A famous April Fools' joke everyone enjoys | A harmless joke that makes everyone laugh | *A trick that hurts someone or breaks things
test: Which word in «Pranks that need cleaning up should be cleaned up by the prankster.» is the clue that the pranks made a mess? | prankster | should | *cleaning | pranks
test: Which word means nearly the same as prankster in a story about a funny trickster? | judge | runner | *trickster | teacher
exam: Mia says a prankster always tells the truth. What is the correct meaning? | A person who sells sweets | A person who always tells the truth | A person who cleans classrooms | *A person who likes playing pranks, tricks or jokes on other people
